  "detail_text": "Please provide a formal quote in addition to a completed solicitation (N4523A-26-Q-4022) via email to andrew.r.smith6@navy.mil or andrew.r.smith7.civ@usnavy.mil - Items must be Mercury free. - Payment will be made by NET 30, after the items have been received by the Navy. - Please provide the name of the manufacturer, and its country of origin. *** With pricing, please include the cost of shipping to Bremerton, WA. *** ** Do not price shipping separately. ** * Shipping; FOB Destination. * *Inspection Code E. The Navy has 7 days to inspect the item before payment is made.*",
